task check-both
  take a, like boolean
  take b, like boolean
  like boolean
  send back, meet and
    read a
    read b

task check-either
  take a, like boolean
  take b, like boolean
  like boolean
  send back, meet or
    read a
    read b

task check-triple
  take a, like boolean
  take b, like boolean
  take c, like boolean
  like boolean
  send back, meet and
    read a
    read b
    read c
